---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { tok } from '../lib/tokens.mjs';
---

<Legal heading="Cookie Notice">
  <p set:html={tok(
    'This Cookie Notice explains how FGFC Markets Global Ltd (“the Company”) uses cookies and similar technologies on this website.'
  )} />

  <h2>1. What cookies are</h2>
  <p>
    Cookies are small text files placed on your device by a website. They are widely used
    to make websites work, to improve their performance, and to provide usage information
    to site operators.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Cookies used on this website</h2>
  <p>
    This website is a static, informational site and sets <strong>no marketing, profiling
    or third-party advertising cookies</strong>. Only cookies or local-storage entries that
    are strictly necessary for the website to function may be used — for example, to
    remember a cookie-consent choice should a consent banner be introduced.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Analytics</h2>
  <p set:html={tok(
    'If the Company introduces analytics in the future, this notice will be updated first, and — where required under [APPLICABLE REGULATORY FRAMEWORK] or local e-privacy rules — your consent will be requested before any analytics cookie is set.'
  )} />

  <h2>4. Managing cookies</h2>
  <p>
    You can control and delete cookies through your browser settings. Blocking strictly
    necessary cookies may affect how parts of a website behave.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Contact</h2>
  <p set:html={tok(
    'Questions about this notice can be addressed to compliance@[DOMAIN] or in writing to [FULL REGISTERED ADDRESS].'
  )} />

  <p class="note" set:html={tok('Last updated: [DATE].')} />
</Legal>
